WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Ryu falls after the forward throw.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.150
Kimberly approaches with raw Rush.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.650
Ryu guards the Rush medium.

4
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.150
Crouching medium kick trades with Ryu’s recorded jab.

5
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.750
Standing heavy punch links after the trade.

6
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.250
Heavy Vagabond Edge launches the trade conversion.

7
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.550
The air grab catches the launch.

8
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:05.900
The trade branch ends in hard knockdown.
